Create a gravity field around you that converts [5%, 17%, 24%, 30%, 34% (TL1-5)] all damage you deal into physical damage, slows incoming projectiles by [3%, 20%, 30%, 38%, 43% (TL1-5)], and protects you from all gravity damage and effects.

Additionally, damage dealt by Repulsion Blast has a [-2%, 29%, 47%, 58%, 66% (TL1-5)] chance to reduce the target's knockback resistance by half for two turns.
